  "title": "Ruth Cullen&#39;s Green Bean Bake",
  "description": "Green beans are baked into a rich, zesty casserole with chili sauce, onion, bacon, brown sugar and a little dry mustard. This dish will add a little excitement to your vegetables!",
  "authors": [
